Testing sample data

```elixir
f = fn -> :pollution_gen_server.get_station_min("9910 Polska, Kraków, Studencka", "PM10") end
res = f.()
secs = (:timer.tc(f) |> elem(0)) / 1000000
{res, secs}

```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
{1.14, 1.1e-5}
```

```elixir

f = fn -> :pollution_gen_server.get_daily_mean("PM25", {2024, 2, 10}) end
res = f.()
secs = (:timer.tc(f) |> elem(0)) / 1000000
{res, secs}
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
{20.524901639344236, 0.002994}
```

## PollutionDataLoader

```elixir
Application.start(:app_pollution)
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
{:error, {:already_started, :app_pollution}}
```

Loading stations

```elixir
PollutionDataLoader.stream_file()
|> PollutionDataLoader.parse_data(&Parser.parse_line/1, ";")
|> PollutionDataLoader.identify_stations()
|> PollutionDataLoader.load_stations()
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
:ok
```

Timing

```elixir
f = fn -> (PollutionDataLoader.stream_file()
|> PollutionDataLoader.parse_data(&Parser.parse_line/1, ";")
|> PollutionDataLoader.identify_stations()
|> PollutionDataLoader.load_stations()) end

microsecs = :timer.tc(f)
|> elem(0)
microsecs / 1000000

```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```
0.145088
```

